%%{init: {'theme':'default', 'themeVariables': {'background':'#ffffff', 'mainBkg':'#ffffff', 'actorBkg':'#ffffff'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as 应用代码
    participant C as v1.Client / ntls.Client
    participant CC as protocol.CoreClient
    participant T as throttle / window / inflight<br/>(流控记账)
    participant TR as ClientTransport
    participant BG as 后台 goroutine<br/>(readControlLoop / ackReaper)
    participant Srv as Server
    participant CB as App 回调<br/>(ackHandler / redirectHandler)

    Note over App,CC: SendBatch(ctx, batch, tag, source, opts)

    App->>C: SendBatch(...)
    C->>CC: 委托 c.core.SendBatch(...)

    Note over CC: ① 生成 chunkID (ULID, 时序可排序)
    Note over CC: ② 编码 + 加密 envelope<br/>(codec + cipher + compression)

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
    Note over CC,T: ③ 流控前置检查
    CC->>T: throttle.Active()?
    alt 被限流
        CC-->>App: ErrThrottle (retry after WaitDuration)
        Note over App: 调用方应退避重试
    else 通过
        CC->>T: window.CanSend(inflight, events, bytes)?
        alt 窗口不足
            CC-->>App: ErrWindowFull
            Note over App: 调用方应阻塞/退避
        else 通过
            CC->>T: inflight.Add(events, bytes) 记账
            CC->>CC: pendingAcks.Store(chunkID, batch) 追踪未 ACK
        end
    end
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
    Note over CC,TR: ④ 写 BATCH 帧
    CC->>TR: WriteFrame(ctx, TypeBatch, FlagEnvelope|FlagData, ChannelData, payload)
    alt v1 (QUIC 多流)
        TR->>TR: picker.Pick(tag, source) 选 data 流
        TR->>Srv: quicStreamWrapper.writeFrameCtx (ctx 感知, 30s 上限)
        Note over TR: 多流并发, 绕过队头阻塞
    else ntls (单连接)
        TR->>Srv: writeMu 串行写 (SetWriteDeadline)
    end
    CC-->>App: return (chunkID, nil)
    end

    Note over App,Srv: 调用方返回, 但 batch 仍 inflight 等待 ACK

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
    Note over Srv,BG: ⑤ 服务端处理 + ACK (异步, 经 readControlLoop)
    Srv->>Srv: processBatch (先 HMAC 后算法校验 → 业务处理)
    Srv-->>TR: ACK / NACK 帧 (control stream)
    TR-->>BG: readControlLoop 收到 ACK

    alt 正常 ACK
        BG->>CC: handleAck(chunkID, mode)
        CC->>T: inflight.Remove(events, bytes) 释放配额
        CC->>CC: pendingAcks.Delete(chunkID)
        CC->>CB: ackHandler(chunkID, ackMode) 异步回调
        Note over CB: 应用层据此推进游标/确认持久化
    else NACK / 超时 (ackReaper)
        BG->>CC: ackReaper 检测 inflight 超时 (5min)
        Note over CC: 未 ACK batch: 内存丢失<br/>(可靠投递由调用方持久化重发负责)
    end
    end

    rect rgb(252, 228, 236)
    Note over Srv,CB: ⑥ 分支: 集群重定向 (TypeRedirect)
    Srv-->>TR: TypeRedirect (非 leader → 指向 leader)
    TR-->>BG: readControlLoop 收到 Redirect
    BG->>CC: dispatchRedirect (独立 goroutine, 防阻塞 control loop)
    Note over CC: redirectInflight atomic.Bool 防并发多 handler
    CC->>CB: redirectHandler(payload) 异步回调
    Note over CB: 应用层应重连到 leader 地址
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 225)
    Note over CC: ⑦ Close() → drain 分支
    Note over CC: SmTransition(StateDraining)
    loop drainCh 通知 pendingAcks 归零
        CC->>CC: 等待 pendingAcks 清空 或 超时
        BG-->>CC: 每个 ACK 触发 drainCh 信号
    end
    Note over CC: drain 完成后 → StateClosed → 关闭 transport
    end
